  # ltedu.system.v1.SystemService

  Metadata every call may carry: x-forwarded-for: <visitor IP>        (honoured only from trusted proxies, like the HTTP API) x-user-agent: <visitor user agent>   (logs and rate limits) Failed calls return a gRPC status whose details hold one ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail

